🔬 MLflow

MLflow helps manage and track Machine Learning experiments.

For example:

Experiment 1 → Accuracy 85%
Experiment 2 → Accuracy 91%
Experiment 3 → Accuracy 94%

===

MLflow helps you track:

Model experiments
Parameters
Accuracy/results
Different model versions

===

Simple comparison

| Application     | Main purpose                    |
| --------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **RStudio**     | R programming and statistics    |
| **Code Editor** | Write and edit code             |
| **MLflow**      | Track and manage ML experiments |


